    {
      "id": 11777,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Enguerran discovered a way to store payloads that would trigger XSS in the MediaElement Flash and Silverlight files that were bundled with WordPress.\n\nWe coordinated a fix with MediaElement, and moved the files from WordPress Core to an optional plugin, since most users no longer needed them.\n\nhttps://wordpress.org/news/2018/01/wordpress-4-9-2-security-and-maintenance-release/",
